    "description": "Whenever you manage to shift the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Attitude\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attitude\">Attitude</a> of a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Beast\" title=\"Beast\">Beast</a> to Indifferent or Friendly, you may treat that creature as a domesticated animal- but for you only (it remains undomesticated in its response to other creatures). Additionally, you may use this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Beast\" title=\"Beast\">Beast</a> as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Mount\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mount\">Mount</a>, as per the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ride\" title=\"Ride\">Ride</a> skill, provided that it is at least one size category larger than you and has a comfortable place for you to sit.",
